		<h1>How GridPermit Works</h1>
		<p class="intro">Three simple steps to generate a preliminary solar and battery estimate and optionally explore quotes through an independent third-party marketplace.</p>

		<h2>Step 1: Enter Your Baseline Details</h2>
		<p>Enter a US ZIP code and estimated monthly electricity bill. The calculator uses regional rate averages and standardized assumptions.</p>

		<h2>Step 2: Review Your Preliminary Estimate</h2>
		<p>Compare modeled solar-only and solar-plus-battery payback, system sizing, and potential long-term savings. Results are educational estimates, not property-specific engineering or financial advice.</p>

